  "steps": [
    "Blend the almond milk, cacao, maca, maple syrup, coconut oil, cinnamon and salt until smooth, or whisk them together in a bowl.",
    "Transfer to a small saucepan and warm over medium-low heat until steaming, 3 to 5 minutes. Do not let it boil.",
    "Taste and add more maple syrup if needed. If it is too thick, whisk in a splash more almond milk.",
    "Pour into 2 mugs and top with coconut whipped cream and shaved dark chocolate, if using."
